<title>USA: NYSE closing averages.</title>
<headline>NYSE closing averages.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK</dateline>
<text>
<p>Prices on the New York Stock Exchange closed mixed in active trading Wednesday.</p>
<p>The Dow Jones Industrial Average rose 4.53 to 6880.70.</p>
<p>The NYSE Composite fell 0.04 to 415.37.</p>
<p>The average price per share was unchanged.</p>
<p>Winners beat losers 1302 to 1148.</p>
<p>Volume was 487,308,700 compared with 480,382,940 on Tuesday.</p>
